@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System State Diagram

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / create account
CreateAccount : do / register after validating
CreateAccount : exit / Login/Invalid registration

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / login
Login : do / login using valid username and password
Login : exit / Invalid login/To home page

state "Invalid login" as InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry / invalid login
InvalidLogin : do / cannot login
InvalidLogin : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / to home page
CheckWeather : do / check weather for current location or another location
CheckWeather : exit / Invalid Location/To home page

state "Invalid Location" as InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry / invalid location
InvalidLocation : do / cannot get valid location
InvalidLocation : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Choose Weather Option" as ChooseOption
ChooseOption : entry / to check weather option
ChooseOption : do / choose what to check (temperature, humidity, rainfall, pressure, or dew point)
ChooseOption : exit / ShowWeatherInfo/To home page

state "Show Weather Info" as ShowWeatherInfo
ShowWeatherInfo : entry / show selected weather information
ShowWeatherInfo : do / update and show the selected weather information
ShowWeatherInfo : exit / ViewAdditionalDetails/To home page

state "View Additional Details" as ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails : entry / to view additional details
ViewAdditionalDetails : do / view additional weather details (alerts, a weekly analysis, a future prediction, or a graph)
ViewAdditionalDetails : exit / Logout/To home page

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / logout
Logout : do / end the session
Logout : exit / [*]

[*] --> CreateAccount

CreateAccount --> Login
Login --> InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin --> [*]
Login --> CheckWeather
CheckWeather --> InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation --> [*]
CheckWeather --> ChooseOption
ChooseOption --> ShowWeatherInfo
ShowWeatherInfo --> ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails --> Logout
Logout --> [*]

@enduml
